// best-route.mjs: lowest-resistance route on the corridor graph + GPX export.
//
// Cost of a road chain = sum over its atoms of length x atomMultiplier (the same weights and rider profile the
// circuit model uses), so this is the single best path under the model, drawn on top of the current map that shows
// how flow spreads across the alternatives. Dijkstra on junction nodes, or on arcs (edge-based) when junction / turn
// costs are on (turns.mjs: route complexity); via = route through every waypoint in order.
